## Why This Is Asked

Probes ability to implement a practical, end-to-end beginner pipeline with drift checks and lineage.

## Key Concepts

- Data Factory pipelines and Data Flows
- Drift validation against expected schema
- Spark MERGE upserts in Synapse
- Purview lineage tagging
- Checkpointing and late arrival handling

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo drift check
function hasDrift(actualSchema, expected) {
  const a = new Set(actualSchema);
  const b = new Set(expected);
  return a.size !== b.size || [...a].some(col => !b.has(col));
}
```

